@startuml AnalystAuth
title Analyst + dual control
actor Analyst
participant IdP
participant Kong
participant Case
participant Audit

Analyst -> IdP: OIDC login + MFA
IdP --> Analyst: JWT roles=analyst
Analyst -> Kong: PUT /cases/id/decision
Kong -> Case: gRPC
Case -> Audit: append hash chain
note over Audit
  Audit DELETE denied by IAM.
  Break-glass needs two approvers.
end note
@enduml
